{"id":"n75973-1-8","stage":5,"title":"주기 · 周期","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75973-1-8-1","ko":"최근에 병이 심해지신 것 같다고요?","zh":"最近您的病情好像变得更严重了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"최근에","meaning":"最近；近来","explanation":"최근：最近；近来；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"최근","audio":"/audio/8124e8864e492d6db495.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89862","senseId":"1","lemma":"최근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병이","meaning":"病","explanation":"병：病；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62694","senseId":"2","lemma":"병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심해지신","meaning":"严重；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"심하다：严重；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같다고요?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；다고요：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8124e8864e492d6d","term":"최근","zh":"最近；近来","audio":"/audio/8124e8864e492d6db495.mp3","entryId":"89862","definition":"从不久前的日子到现在。","pronunciation":["최ː근","췌ː근"]},{"id":"31eaf1068c99d7f1","term":"병","zh":"病","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3","entryId":"62694","definition":"表示“疾病”。","pronunciation":["병ː"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c00041d3b9e9a857e1c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75973-1-8-2","ko":"네, 통증을 느끼는 주기가 점점 빨라지는 것 같아요.","zh":"是的，我感觉到疼痛发作的间隔越来越短了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"통증을","meaning":"疼痛","explanation":"통증：疼痛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"통증","audio":"/audio/42baff33ccfc121915c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49309","senseId":"1","lemma":"통증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느끼는","meaning":"感受，觉得，感到","explanation":"느끼다：感受，觉得，感到；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"2","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주기가","meaning":"周期","explanation":"주기：周期；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주기","audio":"/audio/d5a468e2a038249a546f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75973","senseId":"1","lemma":"주기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨라지는","meaning":"快，快速，迅速；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"빠르다：快，快速，迅速；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"빠르다","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68755","senseId":"3","lemma":"빠르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"42baff33ccfc1219","term":"통증","zh":"疼痛","audio":"/audio/42baff33ccfc121915c2.mp3","entryId":"49309","definition":"疼的症状。","pronunciation":["통ː쯩"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"感受，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"内心经历某种情感。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"d5a468e2a038249a","term":"주기","zh":"周期","audio":"/audio/d5a468e2a038249a546f.mp3","entryId":"75973","definition":"相同的想象或特征自从出现一次后，重复出现为止所经过的时间。","pronunciation":["주기"]},{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"904de91feaff572f","term":"빠르다","zh":"快，快速，迅速","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3","entryId":"68755","definition":"某事达成所用的时间短。","pronunciation":["빠르다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d10e1b8e666bc06d070c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.345,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75973","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":3.8217,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，我感觉到疼痛发作的间隔越来越短了。","最近您的病情好像变得更严重了？","承奎下个月要入伍吧？听说他决定去哪儿了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近您的病情好像变得更严重了？","承奎下个月要入伍吧？听说他决定去哪儿了？","是的，我感觉到疼痛发作的间隔越来越短了。"],"answer":2}]}
